{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_03_existence_checks_and_delete_02_undefined_holes_and_brand_checks_undefined_vs_missing", "label": "undefined versus missing key", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/03-existence-checks-and-delete/02-undefined-holes-and-brand-checks.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "in and Object.hasOwn treat a key holding undefined as present. !== undefined, ?. and ?? cannot tell that from absence. Matters in PATCH and options objects."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_03_existence_checks_and_delete_02_undefined_holes_and_brand_checks_nullish_coalescing", "label": "?? versus ||", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/03-existence-checks-and-delete/02-undefined-holes-and-brand-checks.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "?? falls back only on null/undefined; || falls back on every falsy value. Mixing ?? with || or && is a SyntaxError without parentheses."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_03_existence_checks_and_delete_02_undefined_holes_and_brand_checks_array_holes", "label": "Array holes three states", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/03-existence-checks-and-delete/02-undefined-holes-and-brand-checks.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Present, present holding undefined, and a hole. Reading the last two is undefined. map/forEach skip holes; spread/for...of visit them as undefined. Never create holes deliberately."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_03_existence_checks_and_delete_02_undefined_holes_and_brand_checks_private_